# Delivery Assignment State Machine - FA2

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> UNASSIGNED : Order Ready for Pickup
    
    UNASSIGNED --> OFFERED : System Offers to Partners
    UNASSIGNED --> ASSIGNED : Admin Manual Assignment
    UNASSIGNED --> CANCELLED : Order Cancelled
    
    OFFERED --> ACCEPTED : Partner Accepts
    OFFERED --> DECLINED : Partner Declines
    OFFERED --> EXPIRED : Offer Timeout
    
    ASSIGNED --> ACCEPTED : Partner Accepts
    ASSIGNED --> DECLINED : Partner Declines
    ASSIGNED --> EXPIRED : Assignment Timeout
    
    ACCEPTED --> PICKED_UP : Partner Picks Up Order
    
    PICKED_UP --> COMPLETED : Delivery Completed
    PICKED_UP --> FAILED : Issue Reported
    
    COMPLETED --> [*]
    DECLINED --> [*]
    EXPIRED --> [*]
    FAILED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
```
